ADR;type=WORK;type=pref:;;513 Tremont St.;Boston;MA;02116;USA
NOTE:Cheap\nNew\nSouth End\nSandwiches\nPizza\nIce Cream \nWireless\nOuts\nDelivery\n\nFrom "20 Under $20\," Globe Magazine\, 7/16/06\n\nThey have a waitlist\n\n11AM-11PM every day\n\n——— From the T - Orange Line ————————\n\nTake the Orange line to Back Bay/South End. Exit the station on Clarendon Street. Follow Clarendon Street (in the direction of traffic). Turn left on Tremont Street. PICCO will be on the left.\n\n——— From the T - Green Line —————————\n\nTake any green line train to Copley Square. Exit onto Boylston Street and go in the direction of traffic. Turn right at the next block onto Clarendon Street. Follow Clarendon until it ends and turn left on Tremont Street. PICCO will be on the left.
