FN:Montien
ORG:Montien;
TEL;type=WORK;type=FAX;type=pref:617-338-4697
TEL;type=WORK;type=VOICE:617-338-5600
ADR;type=HOME;type=pref:;;63 Stuart Street;Boston;MA;02116;
NOTE:Thai\nBar\nNiice\n\nTheatre District\n\n\nThe city’s most delicious proof that life exists beyond Pad Thai is found within these neon-lit walls. Authentic and exceptionally fresh dishes dominate chef-owner Tony Suktheva’s Thai menu (ask for it specifically\, or odds are you’ll be handed the Americanized version)\, and they’ve earned him a rabid following. It’s well deserved. Straight from Bangkok dishes like Kai jeaw goong-sub (omelet with shrimp and chili) and Larb gai (super-spicy minced chicken) sing with the region’s sharp flavors: lemongrass\, kaffir lime leaves\, galangal\, and chili. The red curry is smooth\, sweet\, and teeming with gorgeous veggies.\n\nOh! And for the record: There is Pad Thai\, and it’s superb.\nHealthy Thai Cuisine
X-ABShowAs:COMPANY
END:VCARD
